- Moved the commit ordering, no actual code changes

Changes in v3:
- none

Changes in v2:
- The rollback in dpaa2_switch_port_mdb_add() uses the newly introduced
dpaa2_switch_port_fdb_del() helper instead of the _mc counterpart.
